Subject: [PATCH] RK3588S: LubanCat 4: enable the HDMI0 / VP0 display route

rk3588s-lubancat-4.dts ships with every display route include commented out,
so &hdmi0, &hdmi0_in_vp0 and &route_hdmi0 were never set to okay.  Without a
connected output the vop2 driver registers no CRTC at all and DRM fails to
bind ("[drm:vop2_bind] *ERROR* No crtc register, please check dts config"),
which leaves the board with no /dev/dri/card0 and no signal on the
Mini-HDMI2.1 connector.

Include rk3588s-lubancat-4-hdmi0-vp0.dtsi, the vendor provided set for this
board: HDMI0 controller + hdmi0-sound/i2s5 + hdmi0_in_vp0 + route_hdmi0
(connect = vp0_out_hdmi0) + hdptxphy_hdmi0.

--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588s-lubancat-4.dts	2026-10-15 01:01:23.305819354 +0000
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/rockchip/rk3588s-lubancat-4.dts	2026-10-15 01:01:23.305819354 +0000
@@ -33,7 +33,7 @@
  */
 /***** vp0 *****/
 /* hdmi0 display */
-// #include "rk3588s-lubancat-4-hdmi0-vp0.dtsi"
+#include "rk3588s-lubancat-4-hdmi0-vp0.dtsi"
 
 /***** vp1 *****/
 /* dp0 display */
